      propertyPath: lines.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[0].text
      value: There I am! Finally seeing myself after so long...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[1].text
      value: 'No time for that! Use the [W/A/S/D ] keys or the [Left Stick] to get
        over here and pick me up with the [E key] or [X/Square button]'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[2].text
      value: What sort of fearsome creature can't carry a single skull?!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[3].text
      value: I've not eaten in twelve hundred years, fool! Hmm...
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6426123050995192412, guid: 8c33098c500e1a84c95b7d20ac6dc6e2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: lines.Array.data[4].text
      value: What? You better not be thinking of *Throwing* me over using the *Left
        Mouse Button*!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
